; single owner here per CE6 + R1); IcmpSendEcho/SendEcho2/GetBestInterface/GetRTTAndHopCount/
; AddIPAddress/DeleteIPAddress/SendARP added (doc title pages + R1). Ledger: docs/def-restructure-2026-09-19.tsv.
